
// -----------------------------------------------------------------------
// Tenancy convention used across every file in this folder:
//   - Every tenant-owned table carries a scalar `organizationId String @db.Uuid`
//     (plus `locationId`/`departmentId` where the hierarchy applies).
//   - No table trusts client-supplied tenant IDs; the app layer sets these
//     from RequestContextStorage (AsyncLocalStorage), matching Tier 1.
//   - Postgres RLS policies (see rls-policies.sql) enforce this at the DB
//     level via RLSService.applyContext() + set_config(), independent of
//     whatever the application layer does or forgets to do.
//   - IDs are `@db.Uuid` to match Postgres-native uuid columns.
// -----------------------------------------------------------------------
